      "solution": "Mẫu của An: Cỡ mẫu <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Số trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>85</mn></mrow></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>71</mn></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br/>Phương sai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>71</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>65</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>71</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>71</mn></mrow><mo stre